# Apple services that must bypass proxy (DIRECT)
# Some AI rulesets miscategorize these under "Apple Intelligence" and send them
# through proxy, which breaks native Apple services. Keep them on DIRECT.
# Updated: 2026-10-01
# App Store static CDN (fails to load via proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apps.mzstatic.com
# iCloud Private Relay (pointless retries via proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cp4.cloudflare.com
# Legacy Siri backend (high voice latency via proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,guzzoni.apple.com
# Maps / Location / Spotlight (coordinate offset via proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
